4	 * Person Detection with Bounding Box using SSD MobileNet V2
5	 *
6	 * Camera capture logic copied from uvc_test.
7	 * Uses SSD MobileNet V2 INT8 quantized model (COCO) for object detection.
8	 * Draws green bounding boxes around detected persons on the LCD preview.
9	 *
10	 * Usage:
11	 *   person_detection -c -r 0     # Live preview with bounding boxes
12	 *   person_detection -c -r 30    # 30 frames
13	 *   person_detection              # Blank image test
